{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：18:48 2026-11-10 HKT<br/>發佈時間：18:48 2026-11-10 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：18:48 2026-11-10 HKT</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b69210a7da5e6a027a41968e16bfb746/2026-11/002_4.png\"/><p>今日（10日）下午5時許，一名65歲男工人於葵涌貨櫃碼頭南路18號一間物流中心駕駛鏟車期間失事，連人帶車由1.3米高的位置跌落載貨台。男工人一度受傷被困，幸仍然清醒，他被救出後清醒送往瑪嘉烈醫院治理，警方正調查事件。</p><img alt=\"男工人清醒送院。曾志恒攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cbee601523b9d8bd6c7388fff4275f29/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-10_at_18_21_06.jpeg\" title=\"男工人清醒送院。曾志恒攝\"/><p>男工人清醒送院。曾志恒攝</p><p></p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:22.781416+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":204,"images":2,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T10:48:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:34:14.417250+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:53.199492+00:00","content_hash":"144216c30e5460818dd9d037d204179a0790f764f2c3d529ffb144d673786bbe","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}